240-20H.YAG, 2-ele. 20' boom, heavy-duty elements
7.000 7.100 7.300 MHz
2 elements, inches
           4.684    2.250    2.000    1.000    0.750    0.500 
  0.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   66.000   66.000   85.000 
234.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   66.000   66.000   25.500 

The mounting bracket is a 6" x 24" x 0.5" plate,
represented by the 4.684" equivalent OD pipe, 12"
on each side of boom. These elements are capable of
withstanding 93 mph winds without ice; 69 mpw winds
with 1/4-inch ice. 

The front-to-rear ratio is better than 10 dB across
the band, and the SWR is better than 2:1 across the
band, with mid-band free-space gain of 6.0 dBi.
